  "title": "Royalty Pharma Announces R&D Funding Collaboration for Chronic Immune-Mediated Diseases",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, NY, March 30, 2026 - Royalty Pharma plc (Nasdaq: RPRX) today announced a research and development (R&D) co-funding agreement with Johnson & Johnson for a total of $500 million in 2026 and 2027 to advance the development of JNJ-4804, an investigational medicine for autoimmune diseases.",
